WEBVTT

00:00:00.826 --> 00:00:01.933
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> ‘Vivienne,’

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.819
<v><b>Reader:</b></v> said Hartley masterfully,

00:00:05.381 --> 00:00:07.590
<v><b>Hartley:</b></v> ‘You must be mine.’

00:00:08.332 --> 00:00:10.524
<v><b>Reader:</b></v> Vivienne looked him in the eye.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.970
<v><b>Vivienne:</b></v> ‘Do you think for one moment,’

00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:15.667
<v><b>Reader:</b></v> she said calmly,

00:00:15.969 --> 00:00:20.641
<v><b>Vivienne:</b></v> ‘that I could come to your home while Héloise is there?’